---@field MaxFileSize? aws.database_migration_service.IntegerOptional Specifies the maximum size (in KB) of .csv files used to transfer data to Db2 LUW.
---@field KeepCsvFiles? aws.database_migration_service.BooleanOptional If true, DMS saves any .csv files to the Db2 LUW target that were used to replicate data. DMS uses these files for analysis and troubleshooting.

