---@field S3Settings? aws.database_migration_service.S3Settings Settings in JSON format for the target Amazon S3 endpoint. For more information about the available settings, see Extra Connection Attributes When Using Amazon S3 as a Target for DMS in the Database Migration Service User Guide.
---@field DmsTransferSettings? aws.database_migration_service.DmsTransferSettings The settings in JSON format for the DMS transfer type of source endpoint.
