---@field KmsKeyArn? aws.database_migration_service.String The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the KMS key that is used to encrypt the connection parameters for the instance profile.
---@field PubliclyAccessible? aws.database_migration_service.BooleanOptional Specifies the accessibility options for the instance profile. A value of true represents an instance profile with a public IP address. A value of false represents an instance profile with a private IP address. The default value is true.
---@field NetworkType? aws.database_migration_service.String Specifies the network type for the instance profile. A value of IPV4 represents an instance profile with IPv4 network type and only supports IPv4 addressing. A value of IPV6 represents an instance profile with IPv6 network type and only supports IPv6 addressing. A value of DUAL represents an instance profile with dual network type that supports IPv4 and IPv6 addressing.
---@field InstanceProfileName? aws.database_migration_service.String A user-friendly name for the instance profile.
---@field Description? aws.database_migration_service.String A user-friendly description for the instance profile.
---@field SubnetGroupIdentifier? aws.database_migration_service.String A subnet group to associate with the instance profile.
---@field VpcSecurityGroups? aws.database_migration_service.StringList Specifies the VPC security groups to be used with the instance profile. The VPC security group must work with the VPC containing the instance profile.

---@class aws.database_migration_service.ModifyInstanceProfileResponse
---@field InstanceProfile? aws.database_migration_service.InstanceProfile The instance profile that was modified.

---@class aws.database_migration_service.ModifyMigrationProjectMessage
