---@field SourceDataProviderDescriptors? aws.database_migration_service.DataProviderDescriptorDefinitionList Information about the source data provider, including the name, ARN, and Amazon Web Services Secrets Manager parameters.
---@field TargetDataProviderDescriptors? aws.database_migration_service.DataProviderDescriptorDefinitionList Information about the target data provider, including the name, ARN, and Amazon Web Services Secrets Manager parameters.
