---@field TransformationRules? aws.database_migration_service.String A JSON string that specifies the transformation rules for the migration project. Transformation rules let you customize how DMS Schema Conversion converts your source database objects, including renaming, adding prefixes or suffixes, and changing data types. For the transformation rule format and examples, see Transformation rules in DMS Schema Conversion.
---@field Description? aws.database_migration_service.String A user-friendly description of the migration project.
---@field SchemaConversionApplicationAttributes? aws.database_migration_service.SCApplicationAttributes The schema conversion application attributes, including the Amazon S3 bucket name and Amazon S3 role ARN.

