---@class aws.database_migration_service.ModifyReplicationInstanceMessage
---@field ReplicationInstanceArn aws.database_migration_service.String The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the replication instance.
---@field AllocatedStorage? aws.database_migration_service.IntegerOptional The amount of storage (in gigabytes) to be allocated for the replication instance.
---@field ApplyImmediately? aws.database_migration_service.Boolean Indicates whether the changes should be applied immediately or during the next maintenance window.
---@field ReplicationInstanceClass? aws.database_migration_service.ReplicationInstanceClass The compute and memory capacity of the replication instance as defined for the specified replication instance class. For example to specify the instance class dms.c4.large, set this parameter to "dms.c4.large".
---@field VpcSecurityGroupIds? aws.database_migration_service.VpcSecurityGroupIdList Specifies the VPC security group to be used with the replication instance. The VPC security group must work with the VPC containing the replication instance.
---@field PreferredMaintenanceWindow? aws.database_migration_service.String The weekly time range (in UTC) during which system maintenance can occur, which might result in an outage. Changing this parameter does not result in an outage, except in the following situation, and the change is asynchronously applied as soon as possible. If moving this window to the current time, there must be at least 30 minutes between the current time and end of the window to ensure pending ...
---@field MultiAZ? aws.database_migration_service.BooleanOptional Specifies whether the replication instance is a Multi-AZ deployment. You can't set the AvailabilityZone parameter if the Multi-AZ parameter is set to true.
---@field EngineVersion? aws.database_migration_service.String The engine version number of the replication instance.
---@field AllowMajorVersionUpgrade? aws.database_migration_service.Boolean Indicates that major version upgrades are allowed. Changing this parameter does not result in an outage, and the change is asynchronously applied as soon as possible.
---@field AutoMinorVersionUpgrade? aws.database_migration_service.BooleanOptional A value that indicates that minor version upgrades are applied automatically to the replication instance during the maintenance window. Changing this parameter doesn't result in an outage, except in the case described following. The change is asynchronously applied as soon as possible.
---@field ReplicationInstanceIdentifier? aws.database_migration_service.String The replication instance identifier. This parameter is stored as a lowercase string.
---@field NetworkType? aws.database_migration_service.String The type of IP address protocol used by a replication instance, such as IPv4 only or Dual-stack that supports both IPv4 and IPv6 addressing. IPv6 only is not yet supported.
---@field KerberosAuthenticationSettings? aws.database_migration_service.KerberosAuthenticationSettings Specifies the settings required for kerberos authentication when modifying a replication instance.

---@class aws.database_migration_service.ModifyReplicationInstanceResponse
---@field ReplicationInstance? aws.database_migration_service.ReplicationInstance The modified replication instance.

