---@field S3Path? aws.database_migration_service.String The path for the Amazon S3 bucket that the application uses for accessing the user-defined schema.
---@field S3AccessRoleArn? aws.database_migration_service.String The ARN for the role the application uses to access its Amazon S3 bucket.

---The results returned in describe-replications to display the results of the premigration assessment from the replication configuration.
