---@field FailOnAssessmentFailure aws.database_migration_service.Boolean A configurable setting you can set to true (the defualt setting) or false. Use this setting to to stop the replication from starting automatically if the assessment fails. This can help you evaluate the issue that is preventing the replication from running successfully.
---@field Status? aws.database_migration_service.String This describes the assessment run status. The status can be one of the following values:
---@field PremigrationAssessmentRunCreationDate? aws.database_migration_service.TStamp The date which the assessment run was created.
