---@field ResultEncryptionMode? aws.database_migration_service.String The supported values are SSE_KMS and SSE_S3. If these values are not provided, then the files are not encrypted at rest. For more information, see Creating Amazon Web Services KMS keys to encrypt Amazon S3 target objects.
---@field ResultKmsKeyArn? aws.database_migration_service.String The ARN of a custom KMS encryption key that you specify when you set ResultEncryptionMode to SSE_KMS.
---@field ResultStatistic? aws.database_migration_service.ReplicationTaskAssessmentRunResultStatistic

