---@class aws.database_migration_service.Tag
---@field Key? aws.database_migration_service.String A key is the required name of the tag. The string value can be 1-128 Unicode characters in length and can't be prefixed with "aws:" or "dms:". The string can only contain only the set of Unicode letters, digits, white-space, '_', '.', '/', '=', '+', '-' (Java regular expressions: "^([\\p{L}\\p{Z}\\p{N}_.:/=+\\-]*)$").
---@field Value? aws.database_migration_service.String A value is the optional value of the tag. The string value can be 1-256 Unicode characters in length and can't be prefixed with "aws:" or "dms:". The string can only contain only the set of Unicode letters, digits, white-space, '_', '.', '/', '=', '+', '-' (Java regular expressions: "^([\\p{L}\\p{Z}\\p{N}_.:/=+\\-]*)$").
---@field ResourceArn? aws.database_migration_service.String The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) string that uniquely identifies the resource for which the tag is created.

